WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 1=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.180
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:57.780 --> 02:06.260
(The Capital)

02:17.780 --> 02:27.380
♪Only when you reach your mid-thirties♪

02:27.780 --> 02:38.780
♪Do you learn how vast
the world truly is♪

02:40.940 --> 02:51.900
♪You worry about your aging parents♪

02:51.900 --> 03:04.060
♪And your children
yet to find their way♪

03:05.340 --> 03:06.520
=Against the Current=

03:06.520 --> 03:10.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

03:13.380 --> 03:17.860
(Shen Jialan)

03:17.860 --> 03:19.480
(Cui Xuemei,
Shen Jialan's mother)

03:19.480 --> 03:22.080
This protective charm
is for Jinqi, isn't it?

03:23.960 --> 03:25.041
Mother.

03:39.281 --> 03:42.480
The Lin family is one of Jiangnan's
most distinguished families.

03:43.520 --> 03:44.960
And Jinqi's grandfather

03:44.960 --> 03:46.360
is the Minister of Personnel.

03:47.528 --> 03:48.880
Once you marry into their family,

03:49.321 --> 03:50.800
you'll have duties toward his parents.

03:50.841 --> 03:52.601
You won't be as carefree
as you are at home.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.321
I had hoped

03:54.721 --> 03:56.001
that after you came of age,

03:56.104 --> 03:57.960
you could stay with us
for another two years.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.121
But by then,

04:00.321 --> 04:01.760
Jinqi will already be over 20.

04:03.001 --> 04:03.920
I'm afraid the Lins

04:04.721 --> 04:06.321
will be eager for the wedding.

04:13.960 --> 04:14.960
Worry not.

04:15.601 --> 04:18.480
You are the eldest daughter
of Grand Secretary Shen's household,

04:18.961 --> 04:20.721
and the apple of your parents' eyes.

04:23.000 --> 04:26.120
Our family may not come from
generations of high officials,

04:26.961 --> 04:29.120
but our name still carries
considerable weight.

04:30.841 --> 04:33.000
Whether you marry sooner or later,

04:33.800 --> 04:35.721
you'll always have
our family behind you.

04:42.480 --> 04:43.081
Out! Get out!

04:44.281 --> 04:44.560
Go!

04:44.776 --> 04:45.240
Get out!

04:47.680 --> 04:48.560
This is a pharmacy,

04:48.761 --> 04:49.480
not a charity.

04:49.496 --> 04:51.030
If you can't pay, you don't get treated.

04:51.041 --> 04:51.560
Physician!

04:51.560 --> 04:53.980
(Xu Wanquan, Xu Lanxiang's father)
Please, have mercy! Please!

04:54.000 --> 04:55.360
Please save my daughter!

04:56.161 --> 04:58.201
Please show us some compassion!

04:58.296 --> 05:00.730
(Xue Guihua, Xu Lanxiang's mother)
We'll do anything you ask.

05:00.740 --> 05:02.120
We'll spend our lives repaying you!

05:02.201 --> 05:02.890
Go on, get out!

05:02.920 --> 05:04.161
Get moving!

05:04.280 --> 05:05.880
I don't need your family working for me!

05:05.961 --> 05:06.721
Physician!

05:07.161 --> 05:07.680
I...

05:08.360 --> 05:09.000
Please...

05:09.320 --> 05:10.721
I'm begging you!

05:10.961 --> 05:12.161
Please!

05:12.800 --> 05:13.081
I...

05:13.401 --> 05:15.081
She's my only daughter.

05:15.761 --> 05:17.000
Please save her!

05:17.281 --> 05:18.281
Please!

05:18.521 --> 05:19.440
I've told you.

05:19.450 --> 05:20.550
Stop disrupting my business!

05:20.560 --> 05:21.380
Now get out of here!

05:21.420 --> 05:22.400
Please, I'm begging you!

05:22.480 --> 05:22.880
Get out!

05:22.880 --> 05:23.601
Please!

05:23.601 --> 05:24.641
She's our only daughter!

05:24.761 --> 05:25.521
Have mercy!

05:25.560 --> 05:26.320
Let go of me!

05:27.000 --> 05:28.081
I'm begging you!

05:28.081 --> 05:29.081
Please, we beg you!

05:29.201 --> 05:29.920
Don't go!

05:30.344 --> 05:31.000
What rotten luck!

05:31.000 --> 05:31.521
Don't go!

05:32.201 --> 05:33.201
Please don't go!

05:37.120 --> 05:40.281
Have mercy! Please save our child!

05:41.041 --> 05:43.120
Please save her!

05:43.260 --> 05:46.180
(Xu Lanxiang)

05:46.440 --> 05:49.081
Someone, please save her!

05:49.880 --> 05:51.761
(Yong'an Pharmacy)
Please, we're begging you!

05:51.841 --> 05:54.161
We'll do anything you ask!

05:55.680 --> 05:57.440
Please, we beg you!

05:57.680 --> 05:58.440
Save our daughter!

05:58.440 --> 05:58.961
Stop.

05:58.961 --> 06:00.360
Please!

06:15.721 --> 06:16.240
This way.

06:33.928 --> 06:35.300
(Sun Wujing)
Madam, this family

06:35.310 --> 06:37.630
(Madam Cui's housekeeper)
of three is registered servants.

06:37.641 --> 06:39.161
Their daughter has been ill for years.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.041
Fearing it might spread,

06:41.240 --> 06:42.641
their master sent them away.

06:45.401 --> 06:47.761
But the girl's condition

06:47.841 --> 06:49.041
has taken a turn for the worse.

06:49.761 --> 06:50.961
Poor child.

06:52.761 --> 06:54.120
Give them ten taels of silver.

06:54.800 --> 06:55.360
Yes, Madam.

06:58.841 --> 06:59.240
Here.

07:00.920 --> 07:01.961
Take it.

07:06.081 --> 07:06.920
Thank you, Madam!

07:07.761 --> 07:08.880
Thank you so much!

07:09.800 --> 07:10.961
May you and the young lady

07:11.161 --> 07:13.201
be blessed for your kindness!

07:13.320 --> 07:14.440
Thank you, Madam!

07:15.041 --> 07:16.560
Thank you!

07:16.641 --> 07:17.961
Thank you, Madam!

07:18.281 --> 07:19.320
Bless you both!

07:19.320 --> 07:20.041
Please, get up.

07:20.041 --> 07:21.320
Thank you, Madam!

07:21.576 --> 07:23.400
Hurry and take your daughter
to a physician.

07:23.560 --> 07:24.521
Thank you, Madam!

07:25.041 --> 07:26.320
Thank you so much!

07:28.800 --> 07:30.081
Thank you, Madam!

07:31.521 --> 07:34.761
You're so kind, Madam! Thank you!

07:35.521 --> 07:37.041
Thank you, Madam!

07:49.800 --> 07:51.800
Give them my spare set of clothes, too.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.820
(Qiukui, Shen Jialan's personal maid)

07:59.281 --> 08:00.800
Thank you, Madam!

08:00.920 --> 08:02.360
You're so kind!

08:14.721 --> 08:15.480
She can be saved!

08:15.841 --> 08:17.360
- Our daughter can be saved!
- Yes.

08:18.721 --> 08:20.560
Thank you!

08:22.761 --> 08:24.521
These are our young lady's
spare clothes.

08:25.368 --> 08:27.240
She saw how thinly dressed
your daughter was,

08:27.480 --> 08:29.401
so she wanted her to have them.

08:40.641 --> 08:41.560
Thank you.

09:00.260 --> 09:04.281
(Shen Residence, the Capital)
(Virtue Brings Honor)

09:04.281 --> 09:06.080
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.

09:08.361 --> 09:09.881
First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.

09:18.328 --> 09:21.000
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.
- First Madam, Young Lady Jialan.

09:49.560 --> 09:50.361
Father.

09:53.208 --> 09:55.208
The final volume
of my "Statutes Explained"

09:55.280 --> 09:56.870
("Statutes Explained")
has gone missing.

09:56.880 --> 09:57.784
(Shen Boru, Shen Jialan's father)
Did you

09:57.790 --> 09:59.650
(Fifth-Rank Deputy Minister of Justice)
take it?

10:01.960 --> 10:03.481
There's something

10:03.641 --> 10:04.920
I'd like to ask you, Father.

10:06.680 --> 10:07.361
Go ahead.

10:08.761 --> 10:09.800
What makes someone a slave?

10:11.656 --> 10:12.800
What makes someone a slave?

10:16.041 --> 10:16.761
A slave

10:17.281 --> 10:18.080
is chattel.

10:19.241 --> 10:20.241
In other words,

10:20.680 --> 10:22.481
slaves are no different from livestock.

10:23.121 --> 10:24.761
They're their master's property,

10:25.121 --> 10:26.920
to do with as the master pleases.

10:28.241 --> 10:29.041
However,

10:30.241 --> 10:31.481
as their masters,

10:31.720 --> 10:33.320
we're still bound by law and propriety.

10:33.920 --> 10:36.881
We must teach them loyalty,
duty, and integrity.

10:37.112 --> 10:39.200
That's the foundation
of a well-run household.

10:42.680 --> 10:43.641
I understand.

10:45.920 --> 10:47.840
Our Jialan is such a bright
and eager student.

10:49.320 --> 10:51.320
The Lin family is lucky to have her.

10:52.920 --> 10:53.920
In a few days,

10:53.960 --> 10:55.121
we'll host a tea gathering

10:55.161 --> 10:56.401
and invite the Lin family over.

10:57.720 --> 10:59.840
That'll give you and Jinqi
a chance to meet.

11:07.180 --> 11:10.820
(Ever Mindful of the Future)

11:10.820 --> 11:14.780
(Lin Zhaoxiang, Lin Jinqi's grandfather,
Second-Rank Minister of Personnel)

11:18.380 --> 11:19.850
(Lin Changzheng, Lin Jinqi's father)

11:19.864 --> 11:22.060
(Seventh-Rank Registrar,
Court of Imperial Ceremonies)

11:31.481 --> 11:32.281
Grandfather.

11:33.161 --> 11:33.680
Father.

11:34.100 --> 11:36.460
(Young Lin Jinqi)

11:36.720 --> 11:38.121
You sent for me, Grandfather.

11:38.281 --> 11:39.200
What can I do for you?

11:45.001 --> 11:46.121
Many years ago,

11:46.920 --> 11:48.552
Grand Secretary Shen and I

11:48.560 --> 11:51.570
urged the deposed emperor to strip
the regional princes of their power.

11:52.560 --> 11:54.241
Our proposal was rejected.

11:55.200 --> 11:56.481
So much time had passed

11:56.720 --> 11:59.680
that I thought the matter was behind us.

12:00.481 --> 12:01.481
But now,

12:02.761 --> 12:06.320
someone has dredged it all back up.

12:07.800 --> 12:10.641
His Majesty is furious.

12:12.361 --> 12:14.401
You were only doing your duty.

12:14.410 --> 12:16.390
There was nothing wrong
with advising the emperor

12:16.800 --> 12:17.881
to curb the princes' power.

12:18.401 --> 12:19.761
That may be true,

12:19.992 --> 12:22.080
but His Majesty was once
a regional prince himself.

12:22.121 --> 12:23.080
He may use this

12:23.200 --> 12:24.761
to settle the score with our family.

12:30.200 --> 12:30.960
Father,

12:31.600 --> 12:33.440
please tell us

12:33.440 --> 12:35.161
what we're supposed to do.

12:35.920 --> 12:37.761
There's only one thing we can do.

12:39.361 --> 12:40.440
You and I

12:40.440 --> 12:42.560
must submit our resignations at once

12:42.560 --> 12:44.320
and seek refuge in Jinling.

12:45.080 --> 12:48.641
I've appealed to Grand Secretary Zhao,
one of His Majesty's closest advisers.

12:49.560 --> 12:51.320
If I submit

12:51.800 --> 12:53.800
"A Memorial on the
Deposed Emperor's Misrule,"

12:54.241 --> 12:58.001
Grand Secretary Zhao will
intercede for us.

12:58.680 --> 12:59.680
It should...

13:04.121 --> 13:06.920
It should be enough to save
everyone in our family.

13:07.864 --> 13:08.320
All right.

13:08.641 --> 13:10.121
I'll draft my resignation at once.

13:10.121 --> 13:10.641
Right now.

13:10.960 --> 13:11.641
Grandfather,

13:11.920 --> 13:14.041
shouldn't we warn
Grand Secretary Shen first?

13:14.720 --> 13:17.960
After all, I'm engaged
to his eldest daughter.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.641
We'll be lucky to save ourselves.

13:22.680 --> 13:24.600
We can't afford to worry
about another family.

13:41.401 --> 13:42.361
I understand.

13:46.940 --> 13:48.960
(Virtue Brings Honor)

13:48.960 --> 13:52.161
The orchid symbolizes
grace and integrity.

13:52.761 --> 13:55.241
Our family has always prized
scholarship and propriety.

13:56.121 --> 13:58.641
Our daughters are raised
by those same principles.

13:59.121 --> 14:01.361
(Gu Xuan, Shen Jialan's grandmother)
Every one of them is well educated,

14:01.481 --> 14:03.001
(Matriarch of the Shen family)
with the grace and strength of an orchid.

14:03.521 --> 14:05.481
They're every bit as capable as any man.

14:05.881 --> 14:06.680
Exactly.

14:06.881 --> 14:07.680
- Yes.
- Indeed.

14:25.600 --> 14:28.200
Didn't I say not to serve
the peach pastries?

14:28.560 --> 14:29.560
I'll remove them at once.

14:30.088 --> 14:30.860
Jialan, why can't we

14:30.870 --> 14:33.310
(Shen Jialian, Shen Jialan's cousin)
have the peach pastries?

14:33.320 --> 14:36.241
Is there something wrong with them?

14:36.361 --> 14:37.761
There's nothing wrong with them.

14:38.121 --> 14:39.680
They just shouldn't be served today.

14:39.944 --> 14:42.150
I hear the Lins' fourth daughter
is allergic to peaches,

14:42.180 --> 14:43.881
so she can't have
anything containing them.

14:44.121 --> 14:45.200
These pastries

14:45.401 --> 14:47.361
are made with flour
and preserved peaches.

14:47.920 --> 14:49.720
If she eats one by mistake,

14:50.001 --> 14:51.241
we'll have a real problem.

14:53.920 --> 14:55.840
Jialan really does think of everything.

14:56.008 --> 14:56.680
(Xu Chun, Shen Jialan's second aunt)

14:56.680 --> 14:57.790
(Second Madam of the Shen family)
From now on,

14:57.800 --> 14:59.281
(Shen Qi, concubine)
you should learn more from your cousin.

14:59.290 --> 14:59.944
(of Shen Jialan's second uncle)

15:01.121 --> 15:02.361
That's not fair!

15:02.680 --> 15:04.761
Grandmother and I love peach pastries.

15:05.600 --> 15:07.761
Let's do as your cousin says today.

15:08.200 --> 15:09.720
We can have them another day.

15:10.761 --> 15:12.800
They won't taste the same another day.

15:14.320 --> 15:15.440
You're right.

15:15.761 --> 15:17.521
I've had some peach pastries

15:17.560 --> 15:18.680
sent to your room.

15:19.320 --> 15:21.440
We can stay up by the fire
and talk tonight,

15:21.464 --> 15:22.870
and you can eat as many as you like.

15:23.881 --> 15:24.761
It's a promise then.

15:25.161 --> 15:26.920
I'll see you tonight!

15:27.761 --> 15:28.600
I'll be there.

15:32.121 --> 15:33.001
Grandmother,

15:33.680 --> 15:34.800
your digestion is weak,

15:34.824 --> 15:36.520
so you should eat
small meals more often.

15:37.200 --> 15:39.241
I've asked the cook to
prepare peach pastries,

15:39.241 --> 15:40.720
an almond drink, and preserved plums

15:40.760 --> 15:42.400
for you to enjoy after
the tea gathering.

15:42.761 --> 15:44.241
They'll be soothing and nourishing,

15:44.320 --> 15:45.641
and they'll help your digestion.

15:48.472 --> 15:50.200
(Chu Heng, Shen Jialan's third aunt)
See?

15:50.200 --> 15:53.361
(Third Madam of the Shen family)
No one is as thoughtful as Jialan.

15:53.840 --> 15:56.241
She certainly takes after you, Xuemei.

15:58.560 --> 15:59.881
Speaking of being thoughtful,

15:59.960 --> 16:01.641
none of us can hold a candle to

16:02.521 --> 16:04.680
Mother's sharp mind.

16:07.041 --> 16:08.800
It's all thanks to Mother's teaching.

16:08.840 --> 16:09.680
Exactly.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.161
Xuemei is right.

16:19.481 --> 16:21.080
(Mid-morning)
It's already midmorning.

16:21.720 --> 16:24.641
Why isn't the Lin family here yet?

16:39.800 --> 16:40.481
Madam.

16:41.241 --> 16:43.401
These are Young Lady Jialan's
betrothal papers.

16:44.440 --> 16:45.761
And this other document...

16:55.220 --> 16:58.020
(Betrothal Papers)

16:58.020 --> 17:00.580
(Lin)

17:11.740 --> 17:12.830
(Notice of Dissolution of Betrothal)

17:12.840 --> 17:15.330
(The birth charts of Lin Jinqi
and Shen Jialan are incompatible.)

17:15.340 --> 17:17.780
(Their engagement is dissolved,
and they can seek other matches.)

17:17.790 --> 17:18.790
(Signed, Lin Changzheng.)

17:24.481 --> 17:25.441
The Lin family

17:26.281 --> 17:27.761
is breaking off the engagement?

17:39.360 --> 17:40.840
The Lin family has gone too far!

17:44.281 --> 17:46.600
I'm going there to
demand an explanation.

17:48.024 --> 17:49.368
Prepare the sedan chair!

17:49.700 --> 17:51.860
(Virtue Brings Honor)

17:59.360 --> 17:59.961
Over there!

18:00.320 --> 18:00.761
Yes!

18:01.400 --> 18:01.880
Stay close!

18:02.360 --> 18:02.840
Make way!

18:03.120 --> 18:03.600
Move!

18:03.896 --> 18:04.640
Out of the way!

18:04.961 --> 18:05.360
Go!

18:06.060 --> 18:13.460
(Integrity Above All)

18:17.600 --> 18:18.201
Hurry!

18:18.481 --> 18:19.160
Father.

18:20.488 --> 18:23.200
(Shen Qihan, Shen Jialan's grandfather)
The Imperial Guard is here.

18:23.200 --> 18:24.856
(Grand Secretary of Wenyuan Hall
Second-Rank, Minister of Rites)

18:34.001 --> 18:35.001
What are you doing?

18:38.024 --> 18:40.550
We're here under imperial orders
to seize the Shen Residence.

18:44.560 --> 18:45.400
Old Madam Shen.

18:46.201 --> 18:46.961
Madam Shen.

18:47.800 --> 18:48.681
Forgive me.

18:55.201 --> 18:57.840
Grand Secretary Shen Qihan

18:58.392 --> 19:00.760
has deceived the throne and
betrayed His Majesty's trust.

19:01.241 --> 19:03.241
He is guilty of disloyalty to the realm.

19:03.840 --> 19:08.201
Every male member
of the Shen family is to be executed.

19:08.840 --> 19:13.281
The women are to be enslaved
and sent to the Imperial Music Bureau.

19:14.640 --> 19:18.360
All family property is to
be confiscated by the state.

19:19.120 --> 19:19.800
Move in!

19:23.912 --> 19:24.840
What are you doing?

19:27.800 --> 19:28.600
What are you doing?

19:28.681 --> 19:29.800
What do you want from us?

19:30.281 --> 19:31.681
Let go of me!

19:32.721 --> 19:34.080
Keep your hands off my daughter!

19:34.160 --> 19:35.201
What's going on?

19:35.840 --> 19:36.961
Let go of my mother!

19:44.080 --> 19:44.840
Stop!

20:58.500 --> 21:01.660
(Integrity Above All)

21:10.060 --> 21:20.740
(A Clear Conscience
Before Heaven and Man)

21:32.441 --> 21:33.441
Old Madam,

21:34.441 --> 21:36.120
what exactly happened?

21:37.521 --> 21:38.721
Why is His Majesty

21:39.080 --> 21:41.201
accusing Father of treason?

21:46.320 --> 21:50.201
When His Majesty was still
a regional prince,

21:51.921 --> 21:55.521
the Old Master urged the deposed
emperor to curb the princes' power.

21:56.681 --> 21:59.160
Now His Majesty wants him

21:59.441 --> 22:01.761
to denounce the deposed
emperor as an unworthy ruler.

22:03.560 --> 22:06.160
But the Old Master refused
to betray his conscience.

22:09.320 --> 22:12.320
Your father did nothing wrong.

22:18.201 --> 22:19.001
Grandmother,

22:20.001 --> 22:21.681
what are we going to do now?

22:24.201 --> 22:25.160
What can we do?

22:27.281 --> 22:28.201
This is

22:29.840 --> 22:31.360
the Imperial Music Bureau.

22:32.681 --> 22:34.201
They may call it

22:36.241 --> 22:37.521
a place for music and dance,

22:38.360 --> 22:39.800
but in truth,

22:40.241 --> 22:42.600
it's nothing but a state-run brothel.

22:44.681 --> 22:47.800
For over a century, our family

22:48.080 --> 22:51.241
has been known for scholarship,
propriety, and an untarnished name.

22:53.041 --> 22:57.761
The Old Master lived a life
of unwavering integrity

22:58.056 --> 23:00.520
and earned the respect of
honorable men throughout the realm.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.840
As women of the Shen family,

23:04.088 --> 23:05.600
we'd sooner die with our honor intact

23:06.441 --> 23:10.441
than live in disgrace.

23:21.001 --> 23:21.800
Old Madam.

23:23.721 --> 23:26.600
I'm not afraid to die.

23:28.521 --> 23:29.400
But Jialian...

23:33.640 --> 23:35.281
She's only ten.

23:45.001 --> 23:45.921
Grandmother.

23:48.080 --> 23:49.481
I'm not afraid.

23:50.320 --> 23:51.481
Grandfather always said

23:52.281 --> 23:53.721
the Shen family would rather break

23:54.521 --> 23:55.800
than ever bend.

24:13.241 --> 24:14.201
My brave girl...

24:15.481 --> 24:16.241
This...

24:16.761 --> 24:19.241
I had it prepared for myself.

24:20.600 --> 24:23.560
I thought His Majesty
might show some mercy

24:24.201 --> 24:26.201
and punish only the Old Master.

24:27.800 --> 24:28.160
Mother...

24:28.160 --> 24:29.840
If he had, old as I am,

24:30.120 --> 24:31.921
I'd have followed him in death.

24:32.360 --> 24:33.640
But I never imagined...

24:41.721 --> 24:42.441
Grandmother.

24:45.961 --> 24:46.761
Mother.

24:49.800 --> 24:50.921
Don't cry.

24:54.201 --> 24:55.001
Jialan.

25:01.241 --> 25:02.721
I'll go on ahead.

25:04.400 --> 25:06.001
When we meet again in the next world,

25:07.800 --> 25:09.640
let's share some peach pastries.

25:11.360 --> 25:12.201
Jialian...

25:13.800 --> 25:16.241
- Jialian...
- Jialian...

25:20.201 --> 25:21.281
Jialian...

25:22.160 --> 25:25.241
- Jialian!
- Jialian!

25:25.800 --> 25:26.880
Jialian!

25:27.681 --> 25:28.481
Jialian!

25:29.441 --> 25:30.281
Jialian!

25:30.800 --> 25:31.840
Mother...

25:33.281 --> 25:35.441
I'm here, darling. I'm here.

25:35.761 --> 25:39.721
- Jialian...
- Jialian...

25:40.041 --> 25:42.201
- Jialian...
- Jialian...

25:45.761 --> 25:46.840
Jialian!

25:55.201 --> 25:56.921
I'm coming with you.

25:58.521 --> 25:59.281
Chun!

25:59.600 --> 26:00.201
Aunt Chun!

26:06.201 --> 26:09.080
Don't leave me, Jialian!

26:12.681 --> 26:13.761
Jialian!

26:14.281 --> 26:15.080
Aunt Chun!

26:30.160 --> 26:31.360
Jialian...

26:49.441 --> 26:51.201
Use me as a step.

26:55.761 --> 26:56.721
I can't do that!

26:57.080 --> 26:57.800
Mother...

26:59.721 --> 27:02.400
Let me be the one to see you off.

27:03.120 --> 27:07.281
The Shen family has
failed you in this life.

27:08.360 --> 27:09.441
In the next,

27:11.160 --> 27:12.640
we'll repay you.

28:04.201 --> 28:05.041
Mother.

28:08.800 --> 28:10.241
Let me

28:11.640 --> 28:13.761
do my duty to you one last time

28:14.721 --> 28:17.521
and help you go in peace.

28:20.481 --> 28:21.400
Then I'm afraid...

28:23.961 --> 28:26.041
I'll have to trouble you one last time.

29:25.201 --> 29:26.120
My child...

29:30.080 --> 29:31.201
I'm the one...

29:33.800 --> 29:35.400
who gave you life.

29:40.880 --> 29:41.721
Now...

29:44.681 --> 29:47.041
Will you let me take you with me?

29:51.761 --> 29:52.761
That way,

29:53.840 --> 29:55.041
your soul

29:56.400 --> 29:58.080
will always remain by my side.

30:01.400 --> 30:05.160
We'll stay mother and
daughter through every lifetime,

30:08.201 --> 30:09.681
and we'll never be parted again.

30:26.456 --> 30:27.640
Thank you for everything

30:29.360 --> 30:31.721
you and Father have done for me.

30:34.521 --> 30:35.560
In the next life,

30:37.880 --> 30:39.560
I hope I can be your daughter again.

30:55.940 --> 30:57.900
♪A lone figure wanders
down the old lane♪

30:58.940 --> 31:01.420
♪The heart remembers
what time cannot erase♪

31:02.220 --> 31:06.420
♪One thought brings sorrow,
another dreams of brighter days♪

31:08.700 --> 31:11.220
♪I never ask how long the road will be♪

31:11.580 --> 31:13.940
♪Or what changes fate may bring♪

31:14.660 --> 31:19.820
♪I only wish for one
gentle ray of light♪

31:23.820 --> 31:27.100
♪Step by step, page by page♪

31:27.460 --> 31:29.860
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

31:30.260 --> 31:36.460
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

31:36.460 --> 31:39.580
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

31:39.940 --> 31:42.580
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

31:42.580 --> 31:48.980
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

31:58.820 --> 32:04.560
(May Mother and Father Be Safe and Well)

32:04.560 --> 32:07.360
(This protective charm
is for Jinqi, isn't it?)

32:08.400 --> 32:09.481
(Mother...)

32:31.060 --> 32:34.100
♪Step by step, page by page♪

32:34.420 --> 32:37.220
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

32:37.220 --> 32:43.140
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

32:43.580 --> 32:46.740
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

32:46.740 --> 32:49.580
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

32:49.580 --> 32:56.780
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

33:09.120 --> 33:11.041
Heavens!

33:28.560 --> 33:29.441
I was hoping

33:29.720 --> 33:31.040
to take the young, pretty ones

33:31.041 --> 33:32.481
and train them myself.

33:34.080 --> 33:35.241
But now look at this...

33:47.241 --> 33:48.800
The Shen family...

33:51.320 --> 33:52.880
What a stubborn family.

33:57.041 --> 33:58.120
Old Madam Shen.

33:59.521 --> 34:00.961
The eldest Shen daughter.

34:01.961 --> 34:03.080
Third Madam Shen.

34:10.200 --> 34:11.521
Shen Jialian and her mother.

34:22.280 --> 34:23.441
Shen Jialan and her mother.

34:23.841 --> 34:24.640
They're all here.

35:08.760 --> 35:09.441
Child, you...

35:09.481 --> 35:10.361
Let me die!

35:10.401 --> 35:10.801
Let go.

35:10.841 --> 35:11.680
Let me die!

35:11.720 --> 35:12.921
Let me die!

35:13.720 --> 35:15.160
- Please let go.
- Let me die!

35:15.240 --> 35:17.640
- Let go.
- I want to be with my mother!

35:17.680 --> 35:18.240
Listen to me.

35:18.472 --> 35:19.520
Please listen to me!

35:19.720 --> 35:20.560
What's going on?

35:20.560 --> 35:22.881
- Let me die!
- Let go.

35:25.120 --> 35:26.481
Xu, come here!

35:27.001 --> 35:28.200
What's happening?

35:29.361 --> 35:31.760
I want to be with my mother! Let me go!

35:31.961 --> 35:33.361
If anyone aboard hears you...

35:33.401 --> 35:35.560
- Let go!
- We'll all be killed!

35:57.080 --> 35:57.921
Mother...

36:01.441 --> 36:05.361
Why did you leave me behind all alone?

36:08.841 --> 36:09.560
My dear...

36:12.160 --> 36:14.001
If there'd been even the slightest hope,

36:15.481 --> 36:16.640
no mother

36:18.361 --> 36:20.041
would ever willingly watch

36:20.961 --> 36:22.600
her own daughter die before her eyes.

36:56.881 --> 37:00.521
I can never repay you in this life.

37:02.640 --> 37:05.280
If we meet again in the next,

37:05.368 --> 37:07.544
I swear I'll repay the kindness
you've shown me today.

37:07.881 --> 37:09.961
Please don't say that, Madam.

37:11.080 --> 37:12.321
By heaven's grace,

37:12.720 --> 37:16.481
we happened to be lodging at the
Imperial Music Bureau, doing odd jobs.

37:17.321 --> 37:18.640
That's how we found you.

37:21.481 --> 37:22.921
The money you gave us

37:23.600 --> 37:25.481
couldn't save Lanxiang,

37:26.040 --> 37:28.024
but it allowed her to
spend her final days

37:28.040 --> 37:29.280
in comfort.

37:31.160 --> 37:32.280
She was wearing

37:32.321 --> 37:34.361
the beautiful clothes
your daughter gave her

37:35.080 --> 37:36.801
when she passed, happy and at peace.

37:41.441 --> 37:42.361
Go, quickly.

37:42.481 --> 37:44.280
Someone could come at any moment.

38:29.240 --> 38:30.041
Guihua...

38:31.640 --> 38:32.680
Don't worry.

38:34.640 --> 38:35.720
When I reach the other side,

38:37.720 --> 38:39.921
I'll take good care of Lanxiang

38:41.240 --> 38:42.801
and love her as my own.

38:47.600 --> 38:49.080
My daughter, Lanxiang...

38:53.080 --> 38:54.361
Her father's carrying her

38:55.160 --> 38:56.001
on his back.

39:29.680 --> 39:32.160
We left Lanxiang's body in your place.

39:37.160 --> 39:39.481
Now our daughter

39:39.481 --> 39:41.080
is lying there beside your mother,

39:41.480 --> 39:43.496
with no one to lay
either of them to rest.

39:44.801 --> 39:46.321
If you kill yourself,

39:48.321 --> 39:50.481
you'll be betraying
your mother's sacrifice,

39:51.881 --> 39:53.720
and Lanxiang's as well.

40:02.680 --> 40:03.921
And if you really do die

40:04.680 --> 40:06.080
here on this boat,

40:07.240 --> 40:08.401
and word gets out,

40:10.521 --> 40:12.321
we'll probably be killed as well.

40:44.280 --> 40:45.441
Madam asked me

40:46.680 --> 40:48.200
to give this to you.

41:18.140 --> 41:25.220
(May Mother and Father Be Safe and Well)
(LIVE)

42:22.580 --> 42:29.700
(May Mother and Father Be Safe and Well)
(LIVE)

43:04.780 --> 43:07.700
=Against The Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:14.361 --> 43:15.600
Heaven above,

43:16.240 --> 43:17.441
and Earth below, bear witness.

43:18.361 --> 43:21.160
Today, honorable men
have recovered the remains

43:21.441 --> 43:23.560
of the Shen family and Lanxiang

43:24.560 --> 43:26.041
and laid them all to rest.

43:26.920 --> 43:28.360
I owe them a debt beyond measure.

43:29.560 --> 43:31.200
I'll never forget what they've done,

43:31.921 --> 43:33.600
and I swear I'll repay them one day.

43:54.661 --> 43:58.781
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:01.621 --> 44:06.141
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:07.421 --> 44:11.341
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:12.021 --> 44:14.781
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:15.501 --> 44:17.821
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:17.821 --> 44:20.901
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:22.421 --> 44:26.661
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:29.581 --> 44:33.741
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:35.541 --> 44:39.101
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:39.101 --> 44:42.661
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:43.461 --> 44:49.141
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:49.501 --> 44:53.821
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:54.181 --> 44:57.141
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:57.141 --> 45:00.901
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:00.901 --> 45:03.781
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:03.781 --> 45:07.861
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:07.861 --> 45:11.221
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:11.221 --> 45:14.981
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:14.981 --> 45:18.981
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:19.741 --> 45:23.901
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:23.901 --> 45:27.341
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:27.341 --> 45:30.981
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:30.981 --> 45:33.861
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:33.861 --> 45:37.941
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:37.941 --> 45:41.301
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:41.301 --> 45:44.941
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:44.941 --> 45:52.741
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
